// CryptoCell is absent from Renode's nRF52840 platform entirely, so this adds
// rather than replaces - there is no stock peripheral to unregister first. Only
// the CC310 core register file is needed: the wrapper's ENABLE a page below is
// already absorbed from the SVD.
cryptocell: Miscellaneous.NRF52840_CryptoCell @ sysbus 0x5002B000
